 "summary": "Two N-channel enhancement MOSFETs in one SOT-23-6L, their drains tied together inside and brought out on pins 2 and 5, with separate gates and sources. Each is rated 20 V drain-source, ±12 V gate-source and 4.3 A continuous, with on-resistance at most 30 mΩ at 4.0 V gate drive and 46 mΩ at 2.5 V. Named uses are battery-powered systems, load switches and uninterruptible power supplies.",
